DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The iioossff driver provides support routines for platforms using the Intel
     OnChip System Fabric.

     The dwiic(4) driver uses the MailBox Interface (MBI) provided by iioossff to
     coordinate access to I2C devices.

